      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Initially data is an empty field but let we call undefined for\nnow it took the value from onfilled or onrejection of them\ncontain function as well. \n\nweb browser give the accessbility push the request through\nthe network and then they go to the onfilled or onrejection\n\n*note:- network error 404 also go to the Onfulfilled function.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Initially data is an empty field but let we call undefined for\nnow it took the value from onfilled or onrejection of them\ncontain function as well. \n\nweb browser give the accessbility push the request through\nthe network and then they go to the onfilled or onrejection\n\n*note:- network error 404 also go to the Onfulfilled function.",
